<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-INDIA 132-2, WEST INDIES 298 ALL OUT - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 132-2, WEST INDIES 298 ALL OUT - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 132-2 at tea in reply to West Indies' 298 all out on the second day of the third test match at Kensington Oval on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 298 (S.Chanderpaul 137 not out, V.Prasad 5-82); India 132-2 (S.Tendulkar 60 not out).</p>
</text>
